OL,3,GNEWSAZombie and butterfly knives
OL,4,Atargeted in weapon surrender bins
OL,5,Ascheme
OL,6,
OL,7,FCouncils across Northern Ireland have
OL,8,Fbeen asked to install anonymous
OL,9,Fsurrender bins for a range of weapons
OL,10,Fat some of their recycling centres this
OL,11,Fmonth.
OL,13,FThe Department of Justice's (DoJ)
OL,14,FOffensive Weapon Surrender Scheme means
OL,15,Fitems such as zombie knives,
OL,16,Fknuckledusters and butterfly knives can
OL,17,Fbe disposed of safely and anonymously.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
