OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAZombie and butterfly knives
OL,4,Atargeted in weapon surrender bins
OL,5,Ascheme
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhile it is already illegal to posses
OL,8,Fsuch items in a public place, a new
OL,9,Flaw, as part of the Offensive Weapons
OL,10,FAct 2019, will make private possession
OL,11,Fan offence, bringing Northern Ireland
OL,12,Fin line with the rest of the UK.
OL,14,FSome councils have already agreed to
OL,15,Fthe scheme, with most still finalising
OL,16,Fdetails.
